{"title": "Scroll of Summon Quasit", "pageid": 6180, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit", "categories": ["Scrolls", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scroll of Summon Quasit</b> is a single-use scroll. This unique version allows the user to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\">Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit</a> as an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Inky notes slash across the margin of this particular scroll, the angle of the handwriting suggesting urgency. Perhaps warning.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div cl