g.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">QUEST_FOR_SCROLL_SummonQuasit</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_FOR_SCROLL_SummonQuasit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_FOR_SCROLL_SummonQuasit\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6b881dce-b87f-4c3c-aa98-7ba4b07c009b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6b881dce-b87f-4c3c-aa98-7ba4b07c009b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6b881dce-b87f-4c3c-aa98-7ba4b07c009b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\nCasts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\">Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit</a> on use. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar#Graverobber's_Cave\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> behind the moveable bookshelf, in the casket immediately to the right as entering the cavernous room at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-666&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-332</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this scroll summons a unique <a href=\"/wiki/Quasit\" title=\"Quasit\">Quasit</a> familiar named <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(Familiar)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shovel (Familiar)\">Shovel</a> and begins a dialogue interaction with her.</li>\n<li>Shovel can be acquired as a permanent summon either by transcribing the scroll into a wizard's spell book, or through dialogue options. See <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)#Summoning_and_permanently_acquiring_Shovel\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\">Summoning and permanently acquiring Shovel</a> for details.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variant\">Variant</span></h1>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scroll of Summon Quasit</b> is a single-use scroll. It allows the user to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\">Find Familiar: Quasit</a> as an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties_2\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/37px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/49px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scrolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers -->